  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Oculus has recently updated their Asynchronous Space Warp to version 2.0, which supposedly drastically reduces artifacting when ASW kicks in.\n\nWhile the default 1.0 ASW is incorporated by default, 2.0 will require developers to submit depth information, which is doable through Oculus' SDK on Unity.\n\nWhile this wouldn't offer any performance improvements whatsoever, it should drastically improve ASW quality for Oculus users.\n\nSource:\nhttps://www.oculus.com/blog/introducing-asw-2-point-0-better-accuracy-lower-latency/\n\n*attached image is a demonstration for the difference between ASW 1.0 and 2.0",
